# The card-back photograph. Nintendo / Creatures / GAME FREAK artwork, used only to compute ORB
# features — and those are baked into `pokemon-back.npz`, which is what registration loads.
# Keeping the photograph out of the image means a distributable build carries the fingerprint
# and not the picture. Rebuild the descriptors with `make bake-reference`.
app/imaging/assets/pokemon-back.jpg

